      "content": "what do you mean by \"the wood's soul\"? i'm not looking for anything spiritual, i just need practical advice. \n\ncan you finish what you were saying about detecting those internal issues? specifically, what are the technical signs i should look for, and how do i factor those potential \"secrets\" into my safety margins so the structure doesn't fail?",
